**Hand off**: `/pipelex-inputs` prepares the user's files, or test files with planted facts, then `/pipelex-run` runs the method, and `/pipelex-lab` writes answer keys and scores the runs; `/pipelex-catalog` saves it under an `mt_…` id; `/pipelex-integrate` wires it into a codebase (a `package.json` or a `pyproject.toml`), and with neither, `/pipelex-scaffold` creates an app around it.
